# Catalogue sync for every enabled mod source (Thunderstore, Hexium).
#
# Hourly, where the old Thunderstore sync ran every 12 hours, because a sync of an
# unchanged catalogue is now nearly free: Thunderstore answers a conditional
# If-Modified-Since with a bodiless 304 (~0.1s), and Hexium -- which sends no validator at
# all -- is short-circuited on a hash of its 2.2 MB body. A routine tick that finds
# nothing changed costs about 2 seconds for both sources.
#
# Replaces cron.d/tsSyncLocalParse (12-hourly full re-parse) and cron.d/tsSyncRemoteParse
# (15-minutely GitHub seed check). The GitHub seed no longer exists as a sync path: the
# catalogue is read from the sources themselves.
17 * * * * phvalheim /opt/stateless/engine/tools/modSync.py --source all --trigger cron >> /opt/stateful/logs/modSync.log 2>&1
